# One function holding a match of thousands of cases on a run-time value,
# every tenth crashing, each other building a cell and reading it: an op of
# many regions, which once had a graph built per terminator and successor,
# a driver revisiting it once per region, liveness asked once per region
# successor, and ancestor walks per op. Compiled at its size and at twice
# it, no count of the compiler's work grows faster than the program.
step_limit=120
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
. "$root/harness/lib/scale.sh"
scale_relation wide-match
